              <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">Quantum Computing</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed text-xs mb-4 flex-grow">Next-generation computational algorithms (VQE, QAOA, QML) designed to accelerate fluid dynamics and complex optimization problems.</p>
          <a href="/Services/QuantumComputing" class="text-xs font-bold text-cyan-600 hover:text-cyan-700 transition-colors inline-flex items-center gap-1">Learn more <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></a>
        </div>

